        "Description": "Good Afternoon, 47.\r\rYou are contracted by the member of the seven, THE DEEP he is asking that all of his troubles are eliminated in the ways that he sees fitting, your targets are:\r\rValeria Rosetti- a woman the deep showed his gills to but she used them innaproperately\r\rPadre Francesco- The pope in the Church of the Collective, he must be stopped before his lies keep spreading.\r\rGeraldo Dellucci- the man who ejected the deep with the virus\r\rViliberto Branca &amp; Alfredino Russo- both working on V",
